'''Rei''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that could be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.9 Update|Version 2.2.9]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 118
|rarity = SR
|name1 = Rei
|name2 = Rei CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Rei CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Rei has decent damage, speed and enough range for controlling large swarms of Black pushers, but meatshields and attackers must be used well because of the borderline range matchups with common Dark enemies. Her rapid attacks and decent proc chance also allow Rei to consistently slow her targets, acting as a better [[Cat Gunslinger (Rare Cat)|Gunslinger]] with less range and more speed. She's outclassed by [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] due to his much faster cooldown, higher range and the ability to completely disable Dark enemies, which matters the most against enemies that have higher range like [[Dark Otter]] and [[Le'noir]] which are able to easily counter her. Her only edge as of now is the late-game [[Ragin' Gory]], but she is still serviceable early on if you happen to obtain her before Bombercat.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller & Melee}}

